    "Lithium Iron Phosphate (LFP / Blade)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lithium-Eisenphosphat (LFP / Blade)"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lithium Iron Phosphate (LFP / Blade)"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fosfato de hierro y litio (LFP / Blade)"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lithium-fer-phosphate (LFP / Blade)"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "リン酸鉄リチウム (LFP / ブレード)"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Litium-jernfosfat (LFP / Blade)"
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ลิเธียมไอรอนฟอสเฟต (LFP / Blade)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "磷酸铁锂 (LFP / 刀片电池)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lithium Iron Phosphate (LFP) chemistry offers superior cycle life and thermal stability. Charge to 100% regularly (at least every 1–2 weeks) so the Battery Management System (BMS) can balance individual cells and accurately calibrate the SoC estimator." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lithium-Eisenphosphat (LFP) bietet herausragende Zyklenlebensdauer und thermische Stabilität. Laden Sie regelmäßig auf 100% (mindestens alle 1–2 Wochen), damit das BMS die Zellen ausbalancieren und den SoC kalibrieren kann."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lithium Iron Phosphate (LFP) chemistry offers superior cycle life and thermal stability. Charge to 100% regularly (at least every 1–2 weeks) so the Battery Management System (BMS) can balance individual cells and accurately calibrate the SoC estimator."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El fosfato de hierro y litio (LFP) ofrece una vida útil y estabilidad térmica superiores. Cargue al 100% con regularidad (al menos cada 1–2 semanas) para que el BMS equilibre las celdas y calibre el SoC."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La chimie LFP offre une longévité et une stabilité thermique supérieures. Chargez à 100 % régulièrement (au moins toutes les 1 à 2 semaines) pour que le BMS équilibre les cellules et calibre l'estimateur de SoC."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "リン酸鉄リチウム（LFP）は優れたサイクル寿命と熱安定性を備えています。BMSがセルバランスを行いSoC推定を校正できるよう、定期的に（1〜2週間に1回以上）100%まで充電してください。"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Litium-jernfosfat (LFP) gir overlegen sykluslevetid og termisk stabilitet. Lad regelmessig til 100 % (minst hver 1.–2. uke) slik at BMS kan balansere cellene og kalibrere SoC-estimatet."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "แบตเตอรี่ลิเธียมไอรอนฟอสเฟต (LFP) มีอายุการใช้งานรอบชาร์จและความเสถียรทางความร้อนสูงเป็นพิเศษ ควรชาร์จเต็ม 100% เป็นประจำ (อย่างน้อยทุก 1–2 สัปดาห์) เพื่อให้ระบบ BMS ปรับสมดุลเซลล์และประเมินระดับแบตเตอรี่ได้อย่างแม่นยำ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "磷酸铁锂 (LFP) 电池具备极高循环寿命与出色的热稳定性。建议定期充满至 100%（至少每 1–2 周一次），以便电池管理系统 (BMS) 均衡单体电芯并精准校准电量估算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lithium Iron Phosphate (LFP) has an exceptionally flat voltage curve between 20% and 90%, making voltage-based SoC estimation prone to drift without regular 100% top-offs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lithium-Eisenphosphat (LFP) besitzt eine sehr flache Spannungskurve zwischen 20% und 90%, weshalb das BMS regelmäßige 100%-Ladungen zur Kalibrierung benötigt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lithium Iron Phosphate (LFP) has an exceptionally flat voltage curve between 20% and 90%, making voltage-based SoC estimation prone to drift without regular 100% top-offs."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El fosfato de hierro y litio (LFP) tiene una curva de voltaje muy plana entre el 20% y el 90%, por lo que necesita cargas al 100% para calibrar el SoC."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le lithium-fer-phosphate (LFP) a une courbe de tension très plate entre 20 % et 90 %, ce qui rend l'estimation du SoC sujette à dérive sans recharge régulière à 100 %."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "リン酸鉄リチウム（LFP）は20%〜90%間の電圧曲線が極めて平坦なため、定期的に100%まで充電しないとSoC推定がずれる原因になります。"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Litium-jernfosfat (LFP) har en svært flat spenningskurve mellom 20 % og 90 %, noe som krever jevnlig 100 % lading for å unngå avvik i BMS-estimeringen."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "แบตเตอรี่ลิเธียมไอรอนฟอสเฟต (LFP) มีกราฟแรงดันไฟฟ้าที่แบนราบมากระหว่าง 20% ถึง 90% ทำให้ระบบ BMS จำเป็นต้องชาร์จเต็ม 100% เป็นประจำเพื่อปรับเทียบค่าให้ตรง"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "磷酸铁锂 (LFP) 在 20% 到 90% 之间的电压曲线极为平坦，若不定期充满至 100%，BMS 的电量估算容易产生偏差。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
