            "value" : "Nikkel-mangan-kobolt (NMC / NCM)"
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "นิกเกิลแมงกานีสโคบอลต์ (NMC / NCM)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "镍锰钴三元锂 (NMC / NCM)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nickel Manganese Cobalt (NMC) chemistry provides high energy density. For daily driving, maintain a charge limit between 80% and 90% to avoid prolonged cathode voltage stress. Charge to 100% only prior to departure on long road trips." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nickel-Mangan-Cobalt (NMC) bietet hohe Energiedichte. Begrenzen Sie das Laden im Alltag auf 80%–90%, um Kathodenspannungsstress zu vermeiden. Laden Sie nur vor langen Fahrten auf 100%."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nickel Manganese Cobalt (NMC) chemistry provides high energy density. For daily driving, maintain a charge limit between 80% and 90% to avoid prolonged cathode voltage stress. Charge to 100% only prior to departure on long road trips."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El níquel-manganeso-cobalto (NMC) ofrece alta densidad energética. En el día a día, mantenga el límite entre 80% y 90%. Cargue al 100% solo antes de viajes largos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La chimie NMC offre une haute densité énergétique. Au quotidien, maintenez une limite entre 80 % et 90 % pour éviter le stress haute tension. Réservez le 100 % aux longs trajets."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ニッケル・マンガン・コバルト（NMC）は高いエネルギー密度を提供します。日常の走行では高電圧負荷を避けるため80%〜90%に制限し、100%充電は長距離ドライブ直前のみにしてください。"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nikkel-mangan-kobolt (NMC) gir høy energitetthet. Hold daglig ladegrense på 80 %–90 % for å unngå høyspent stress. Lad til 100 % kun rett før langkjøring."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "แบตเตอรี่นิกเกิลแมงกานีสโคบอลต์ (NMC) มีความหนาแน่นพลังงานสูง สำหรับการขับขี่ประจำวันควรจำกัดการชาร์จไว้ที่ 80%–90% เพื่อหลีกเลี่ยงความเค้นแรงดันสูง และชาร์จเต็ม 100% เฉพาะก่อนออกเดินทางไกลเท่านั้น"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "镍锰钴三元锂 (NMC) 具有高能量密度。日常行驶请将充电限制设定在 80% 至 90% 之间，避免正极长期承受高电压。仅在长途出行出发前才充至 100%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nickel-rich chemistry undergoes accelerated cathode electrolyte oxidation and mechanical lattice strain when kept above 90% State of Charge." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nickelreiche Akkus unterliegen bei über 90% SoC einer beschleunigten Kathodenoxidation und mechanischen Gitterspannungen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nickel-rich chemistry undergoes accelerated cathode electrolyte oxidation and mechanical lattice strain when kept above 90% State of Charge."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las baterías ricas en níquel sufren mayor oxidación y estrés mecánico cuando se mantienen por encima del 90% de carga."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les batteries riches en nickel subissent une oxydation accélérée et des tensions mécaniques lorsqu'elles sont maintenues au-dessus de 90 % de SoC."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "高ニッケル系電池は90%以上のSoCで保持されると、正極酸化と格子歪みが加速します。"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nikkelrike kjemier opplever akselerert oksidasjon og mekanisk spenning når de holdes over 90 % SoC."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "แบตเตอรี่นิเกิลสูงจะเกิดปฏิกิริยาออกซิเดชันและความเค้นของผลึกสูงขึ้นอย่างมากเมื่อคงระดับไว้เกิน 90%"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "高镍三元电池在电量超过 90% 时会加速正极电解液氧化并造成晶格机械应变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
