          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You primarily use gentle AC slow charging, keeping cell temperatures low and protecting the Solid Electrolyte Interphase (SEI) layer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sie nutzen überwiegend schonendes AC-Laden, was die Zelltemperaturen niedrig hält und die SEI-Schicht schützt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You primarily use gentle AC slow charging, keeping cell temperatures low and protecting the Solid Electrolyte Interphase (SEI) layer."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utiliza principalmente carga lenta de CA, manteniendo bajas las temperaturas y protegiendo la capa SEI."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous utilisez principalement la charge lente AC, maintenant des températures basses et protégeant la couche SEI."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主に穏やかな普通充電（AC）を使用しており、セル温度を低く保ちSEI被膜を保護しています。"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bruker primært skånsom AC-saktelading, noe som holder celletemperaturen lav og beskytter SEI-laget."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "คุณชาร์จด้วยไฟกระแสสลับ AC เป็นหลัก ช่วยให้อุณหภูมิเซลล์ต่ำและถนอมชั้น SEI ได้อย่างดี"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您主要使用温和的交流慢充，使电芯保持较低温度并保护 SEI 膜。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You regularly charge to 100%, keeping your LFP battery cells balanced." : {
